<div class="heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">One-time setup</div><h1>Overtime module is ready for installation</h1></div></div>
<div class="card"><h2>Database update required</h2><p>Run <strong>Database/overtime_004_cost_and_email.sql</strong> once to enable overtime cost rates, cost reporting and the request/decision email log. Earlier installations must first run <strong>overtime_001.sql</strong>, <strong>overtime_002_permissions.sql</strong> and <strong>overtime_003_team_requests.sql</strong>, in that order.</p><p>Every file is safe to rerun, and existing requests, approval history and assignments are preserved.</p></div>
